@startuml
title Интеграция монолита с микросервисами (MVP)

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "Smart Home\n(Монолит)" as Monolith
participant "Temperature API" as TempAPI
database "PostgreSQL\n(sensors)" as PG_Sensors
queue "Kafka\ndevice.events" as KafkaDeviceEvents
queue "Kafka\ndevice.telemetry" as KafkaTelemetry
participant "Device Registry" as DeviceRegistry
database "PostgreSQL\n(devices)" as PG_Devices
participant "Telemetry Service" as TelemetryService
database "PostgreSQL\n(telemetry_data)" as PG_Telemetry

== 1. Создание сенсора (CRUD → Device Registry через Kafka) ==

User -> Monolith: POST /api/v1/sensors\n{name, type, location, unit}
activate Monolith
Monolith -> PG_Sensors: INSERT INTO sensors
PG_Sensors --> Monolith: sensor (id, name, ...)
Monolith ->> KafkaDeviceEvents: SENSOR_CREATED\n{device_id, device_name, device_type, location}
Monolith --> User: 201 Created {sensor}
deactivate Monolith

KafkaDeviceEvents -> DeviceRegistry: consume SENSOR_CREATED
activate DeviceRegistry
DeviceRegistry -> PG_Devices: INSERT INTO devices
PG_Devices --> DeviceRegistry: device
deactivate DeviceRegistry

== 2. Обновление сенсора ==

User -> Monolith: PUT /api/v1/sensors/:id\n{name, location, ...}
activate Monolith
Monolith -> PG_Sensors: UPDATE sensors SET ...
PG_Sensors --> Monolith: sensor
Monolith ->> KafkaDeviceEvents: SENSOR_UPDATED\n{device_id, device_name, ...}
Monolith --> User: 200 OK {sensor}
deactivate Monolith

KafkaDeviceEvents -> DeviceRegistry: consume SENSOR_UPDATED
activate DeviceRegistry
DeviceRegistry -> PG_Devices: UPDATE devices SET ...
deactivate DeviceRegistry

== 3. Удаление сенсора ==

User -> Monolith: DELETE /api/v1/sensors/:id
activate Monolith
Monolith -> PG_Sensors: DELETE FROM sensors
Monolith ->> KafkaDeviceEvents: SENSOR_DELETED\n{device_id}
Monolith --> User: 200 OK
deactivate Monolith

KafkaDeviceEvents -> DeviceRegistry: consume SENSOR_DELETED
activate DeviceRegistry
DeviceRegistry -> PG_Devices: DELETE FROM devices
deactivate DeviceRegistry

== 4. Получение сенсоров с телеметрией ==

User -> Monolith: GET /api/v1/sensors
activate Monolith
Monolith -> PG_Sensors: SELECT * FROM sensors
PG_Sensors --> Monolith: sensors[]

loop для каждого temperature-сенсора
    Monolith -> TempAPI: GET /temperature/{sensorId}
    TempAPI --> Monolith: {value, unit, status}
    Monolith ->> KafkaTelemetry: TelemetryEvent\n{device_id, metric_name, value, unit}
end

Monolith --> User: 200 OK {sensors[]}
deactivate Monolith

KafkaTelemetry -> TelemetryService: consume TelemetryEvent
activate TelemetryService
TelemetryService -> PG_Telemetry: INSERT INTO telemetry_data
deactivate TelemetryService

== 5. Запрос истории телеметрии ==

User -> TelemetryService: GET /api/v1/telemetry/:deviceId
activate TelemetryService
TelemetryService -> PG_Telemetry: SELECT * FROM telemetry_data\nWHERE device_id = :id
PG_Telemetry --> TelemetryService: telemetry_data[]
TelemetryService --> User: 200 OK {telemetry[]}
deactivate TelemetryService

@enduml
